    <item>
      <title>中央情报局。特朗普向哈瓦那施压，成立古巴秘密工作组</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/05/us/politics/cia-cuba-task-force.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[该工作组将使间谍机构能够迅速将更多的财政、人力和技术资源投入古巴，其目的是在古巴政治精英之间制造裂痕。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/05/us/politics/cia-cuba-task-force.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 00:30:39 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
