    <item>
      <title>密歇根州失利后，AIPAC 考虑再次努力击败埃尔-赛义德</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/05/us/politics/aipac-michigan-general-election.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[这个亲以色列组织花费了 3200 万美元，试图在密歇根州民主党参议院初选中击败阿卜杜勒·赛义德，但没有成功。它可能会在大选中再次尝试。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/05/us/politics/aipac-michigan-general-election.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 23:48:35 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普称卡塔尔喷气式飞机的目的地是他的图书馆。这可能会改变。</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/05/us/trump-air-force-one-qatar-library.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[一名白宫官员表示，尚未就哪架飞机将在特朗普总统图书馆展出做出最终决定。这使得卡塔尔飞机的命运尚不清楚。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/05/us/trump-air-force-one-qatar-library.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 21:58:59 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普支持的密歇根州候选人初选输给暂停竞选活动的竞争对手</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/05/us/politics/trump-hassan-smith-loses-michigan-primary.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[暂停竞选的汤姆·史密斯没有投放任何广告，也没有提交竞选财务报告，就彻底击败了特朗普总统支持的海军退伍军人阿米尔·哈桑。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/05/us/politics/trump-hassan-smith-loses-michigan-primary.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 21:51:43 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
